abstract: >-
  Reproducible software artifact for standards-traceable security evidence
  management across ISO/IEC 27001:2022 and NIST CSF 2.0. The artifact provides
  UML/XMI traceability, GQM evidence intent, provenance-aware evidence structures,
  structural validation, reproducible reporting, and an IoT telemetry case-study
  profile. Tested interoperability is limited to structural portability across
  the documented Papyrus and Enterprise Architect versions; lossless or general
  UML/OCL interoperability is not claimed.
